%% End-to-end request lifecycle for demos
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser
    participant H as Firebase Hosting
    participant A as Firebase Auth
    participant F as Firebase Functions (/api)
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant ST as Cloud Storage
    participant G as Gemini
    participant M as Gmail

    U->>H: Load /launchkey (static export)
    U->>A: Anonymous sign-in (demo)
    A-->>U: ID token
    U->>F: /api/profiles (ID token)
    F->>FS: create/read profile
    U->>F: /api/leads/upload-url
    F-->>U: Signed URL
    U->>ST: Upload CSV/JSON
    ST-->>F: processUpload trigger
    F->>FS: Upsert leads
    U->>F: /api/drafts (lead IDs)
    F->>G: Draft generation
    G-->>F: Drafts
    F->>FS: Store emailDrafts
    U->>F: /api/send (optional)
    F->>FS: Read gmailTokens (if configured)
    F->>M: Send via OAuth token
    Note over U,F: /api/send uses UI draft payload\nemailDrafts stored for history only
